h","content":[{"type":"text","text":"有曲有直时，优先单独数曲线数"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"一笔画判断：奇点数为 0 或 2 → 可一笔画；笔画数 = 奇点数 ÷ 2"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"常考一笔画图形：五角星及变形、日字及变形"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"常考两笔画图形：田字及变形、相切/相交圆"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三、解题步骤"}]},{"type":"textDiagram","attrs":{"language":"mermaid"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"flowchart TD\n    A[观察图形] --> B{线条多且杂?}\n    B -->|是| C{有曲有直?}\n    C -->|是| D[优先数曲线数]\n    C -->|否| E[数直线数]\n    B -->|否| F{出现汉字/字母?}\n    F -->|是| G[考虑笔画数]\n    F -->|否| H[数线条总数]\n    D --> I[找数字规律]\n    E --> I\n    G --> J[奇点法判断]\n    H --> I\n    J --> I\n    I --> K[代入验证]"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"四、真题精讲"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"【例题】第一组图形笔画数分别为 3、4、5；第二组图形由直线和曲线构成，直线加曲线的个数分别为 4、5、(?)。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第一组汉字笔画数呈等差：3、4、5 → 公差为 1"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第二组线条数：4、5 → 继续等差，下一项应为 6"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"验证：选项中只有线条数为 6 的图形符合"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"五、易错点"}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#fef2f2","borderColor":"#ef4444","icon":"⚠️"},"content":[{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"「直线」遇到拐弯要另算一条，不要把折线当成一条线"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"「曲线」遇到拐点另算一条"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"一笔画的奇点判断：